From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2026 07:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: allow powermgr to reach db8 and the alarm service

LunaPmsRoot stores its kind in db8 and clears alarms:

  src/PmsLunaInterface/LunaPmsRoot.cpp:641  luna://com.palm.db/putKind
  src/PmsLunaInterface/LunaPmsRoot.cpp:673  luna://com.palm.db/...
  src/PmsLunaInterface/LunaPmsRoot.cpp:790  luna://com.webos.service.alarm/clear
  src/PmsLunaInterface/LunaPmsRoot.cpp:859  luna://com.webos.service.alarm/...

The role permits outbound to connectionmanager only, so every one of
those calls is refused by ls-hubd at the name query.
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.service.power2.role.json.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(s), 1 deletion(s)

--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.power2.role.json.in
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.webos.service.power2.role.json.in
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@
        "permissions": [
            {
                "service":"com.webos.service.power2",
-               "outbound":["com.webos.service.connectionmanager"]
+               "outbound":["com.webos.service.connectionmanager", "com.palm.db", "com.webos.service.alarm"]
            }
        ]
 }
